sequenceDiagram
    participant Viewer
    participant Web as cctv-web
    participant API as cctv-api
    participant Gateway
    participant Camera
    participant LK as LiveKit Cloud

    Viewer->>Web: Open authorized camera tile
    Web->>API: Request viewer token and stream presence
    API->>API: Check RBAC and camera ACL
    API-->>Web: Return short-lived viewer token
    API->>Gateway: Command start publish over outbound channel
    Gateway->>Camera: Pull RTSP on site LAN
    Gateway->>LK: Publish camera media
    Web->>LK: Subscribe with viewer-only token
    LK-->>Viewer: Deliver live media
    Viewer->>Web: Close tile
    Web->>API: Report viewer left
    API->>Gateway: Stop publish if no viewers remain
